进入蓝黑色二维房间。空间仅由几个强烈平面色块构成：深蓝墙面、黑色阴影、猩红色沙发。反派翘着二郎腿坐在沙发上，缓慢摇晃酒杯。灰色长发和黑色帽檐形成清晰剪影。切入酒杯极近特写，红色液体旋转，杯中倒映出女主的黑色剪影；焦点随几何圆环移动到反派面部，他从帽檐阴影中抬眼，露出从容而危险的微笑。19–20秒反派停止摇晃酒杯，红色液面瞬间静止。杯子轮廓碎裂成蓝黑色几何切片，原创游戏标题由时钟刻度与刀刃形状重新拼合，出现英文文案：“FACE THE NIGHT”【严格限制】全片保持二维抽象MG和冷蓝游戏UI美术；不要写实光影，不要立体3D城市，不要电影级真实透视，不要普通赛璐璐战斗番，不要复杂连续打斗，不要大面积霓虹灯，不要赛博朋克写实街景。人物、建筑、房间和道具全部平面化、剪影化、图形化，所有镜头都像一张动态平面海报。\n", null, "540P", "16:9", 1344, 768, 15, false, 24, "首帧优先", "短边最大1K像素", "按序号"], "inputs": [{"name": "h3_bundle", "link": 1, "label": "h3_bundle", "type": "MINIMAX_H3_BUNDLE", "localized_name": "H3 模型组合"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "media", "label": "media", "type": "*", "localized_name": "Media"}, {"widget": {"name": "mode"}, "name": "mode", "label": "mode", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "mode"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "resolution"}, "name": "resolution", "label": "resolution", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "resolution"}, {"widget": {"name": "aspect_ratio"}, "name": "aspect_ratio", "label": "aspect_ratio", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "aspect_ratio"}, {"widget": {"name": "width"}, "name": "width", "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"widget": {"name": "height"}, "name": "height", "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}, {"widget": {"name": "seconds"}, "name": "seconds", "label": "seconds", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "seconds"}, {"widget": {"name": "advanced"}, "name": "advanced", "label": "advanced", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "advanced"}, {"widget": {"name": "fps"}, "name": "fps", "label": "fps", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "fps"}, {"widget": {"name": "keyframe_role"}, "name": "keyframe_role", "label": "keyframe_role", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "keyframe_role"}, {"widget": {"name": "ref_image_size"}, "name": "ref_image_size", "label": "ref_image_size", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "ref_image_size"}, {"widge